  "description": "For everyday use, but with mountain bike vibes: The GHOST E-Teru Advanced EQ is your e-bike for every day. No matter whether you spend a lot of time on the road or like to explore gravel and forest paths, the robust aluminum frame and the SR Suntour suspension fork with 100mm travel offer you maximum safety and comfort. The powerful Bosch motor and the 800 WH battery power allow you to easily cover long distances, in the city as well as on tours. With a permissible total weight of 150 kg, the bike always remains stable and safe, even with a lot of luggage. Fully equipped with lights, mudguards and luggage rack, it is the ideal companion for anyone who rides an e-bike every day.",
